Caspolano is played out. Its shafts stand empty, and the miners have long gone to work the fields."},{"icon":"glyph-1f309","type":"bridges","px":14,"x":322.4,"y":310.71,"cell":2328,"i":8,"name":"Yayaz Te Bridge","tags":[],"note":"A formidable bridge spans over the Yayunt Creek at Yayaz Te. Carts and pack trains cross it from dawn to dusk, bound for the market."},{"icon":"glyph-2696-fe0f","type":"merchant-houses","x":163.86,"y":399.63,"cell":3363,"i":9,"name":"House of Merecs","tags":[],"note":"A merchant family of Ujsgyartes, one of the richest in the land. Its factors buy and sell across the whole market, and a share of every deal ends in its coffers."},{"icon":"glyph-2696-fe0f","type":"merchant-houses","x":640.16,"y":216.9,"cell":1404,"i":10,"name":"House of Sampiverno","tags":[],"note":"A merchant family of Riverpino, one of the richest in the land. Its factors buy and sell across the whole market, and a share of every deal ends in its coffers."},{"icon":"glyph-2696-fe0f","type":"merchant-houses","x":1808.77,"y":319.51,"cell":2605,"i":11,"name":"House of Zikh","tags":[],"note":"A merchant family of Apet-Ubo, one of the richest in the land. Its factors buy and sell across the whole market, and a share of every deal ends in its coffers."},{"icon":"glyph-2696-fe0f","type":"merchant-houses","x":1771.36,"y":642.98,"cell":5803,"i":12,"name":"House of Yekoaninido","tags":[],"note":"A merchant family of Gevohad, one of the richest in the land. Its factors buy and sell across the whole market, and a share of every deal ends in its coffers."},{"icon":"glyph-2696-fe0f","type":"merchant-houses","x":267,"y":415.46,"cell":3510,"i":13,"name":"House of Akakeli","tags":[],"note":"A merchant family of Ultaydil, one of the richest in the land. Its factors buy and sell across the whole market, and a share of every deal ends in its coffers."},{"icon":"glyph-2696-fe0f","type":"merchant-houses","x":198.78,"y":197.93,"cell":1250,"i":14,"name":"House of Balazde","tags":[],"note":"A merchant family of Ayli, one of the richest in the land. Its factors buy and sell across the whole market, and a share of every deal ends in its coffers."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1020.63,"y":502.58,"cell":4396,"i":15,"name":"The Prime Inn","tags":[],"note":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious pan-fried duck with sour brandy is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1563.05,"y":499.79,"cell":4441,"i":16,"name":"The White Antelope","tags":[],"note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious syrupped beet with sparkling cider is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":462.05,"y":41.34,"cell":147,"i":17,"name":"The Giant Inn","tags":[],"note":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious fried duck with ice kvass is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":621.34,"y":261.29,"cell":1941,"i":18,"name":"The Green Camel","tags":[],"note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious cured badger with brown cider is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1675.3,"y":619.21,"cell":5535,"i":19,"name":"The Bright Crane","tags":[],"note":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious corned chickpea with sour vodka is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1714.52,"y":603.65,"cell":5406,"i":20,"name":"The Purple Beaver","tags":[],"note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious smoked beaver with grey water is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":413.63,"y":435.85,"cell":3671,"i":21,"name":"The High Tavern","tags":[],"note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious jugged beet with bitter juice is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1813.14,"y":454.56,"cell":4069,"i":22,"name":"The Magical Goose","tags":[],"note":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious stewed goose with red whisky is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1513.76,"y":104.99,"cell":524,"i":23,"name":"The White Ibis","tags":[],"note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious stuffed apples with smoky nectar is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1295.92,"y":332.47,"cell":2725,"i":24,"name":"The Divine Tavern","tags":[],"note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious flame-broiled garlic with hot sap is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":640.99,"y":92.66,"cell":381,"i":25,"name":"The Fair Raven","tags":[],"note":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious roasted pasta with sparkling water is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1444.86,"y":139.86,"cell":862,"i":26,"name":"The Friendly Tavern","tags":[],"note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious flame-broiled deer with sparkling rum is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1726.8,"y":504.15,"cell":4570,"i":27,"name":"The Light Ibis","tags":[],"note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious stuffed hare with pink spirits is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6a8","type":"lighthouses","px":14,"x":1172.64,"y":682.78,"cell":6077,"i":28,"name":"Bobertaldenese Lighthouse","tags":[],"note":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":1038.01,"y":630.29,"cell":5603,"i":29,"name":"Glattenma Battlefield","tags":[],"note":"A historical battle of the Steimonsian Conquest. \r\nDate: August 5, 1089 Hyang Era."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":1603.37,"y":238.33,"cell":1733,"i":30,"name":"Yizim Battlefield","tags":[],"note":"A historical battle of the Samia-Rotnauhian War. \r\nDate: June 5, 1049 Hyang Era."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":362.73,"y":255.99,"cell":1785,"i":31,"name":"Yarnuzun Battlefield","tags":[],"note":"A historical battle of the Topkyurt Campaign. \r\nDate: October 8, 1014 Hyang Era."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":1501.39,"y":123.45,"cell":744,"i":32,"name":"Ebebalgota Battlefield","tags":[],"note":"A historical battle of the Yampiduan War. \r\nDate: June 20, 1302 Hyang Era."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":1522.81,"y":361.46,"cell":3050,"i":33,"name":"Dungeon","tags":[],"note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=5108111563050\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=5108111563050\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":282.5,"y":424.49,"cell":3660,"i":34,"name":"Dungeon","tags":[],"note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=5108111563660\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=5108111563660\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f409","type":"lake-monsters","dy":48,"x":1341.6,"y":124.73,"cell":729,"i":35,"name":"Bongen Monster","tags":[],"note":"Locals say a relic monster of 13 m long inhabits Bongen Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":817.28,"y":682.39,"cell":6050,"i":36,"name":"Buclif Monster","tags":[],"note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 24 m long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":904.84,"y":270.08,"cell":1959,"i":37,"name":"Dunscom Monster","tags":[],"note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 27 m long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f479","type":"hill-monsters","dy":54,"px":13,"x":375.65,"y":402.97,"cell":3378,"i":38,"name":"Voropos Giant","tags":[],"note":"Tipplers speak of a huge Giant who inhabits Voropos hills and doesn't mind human flesh."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":957.22,"y":531.95,"cell":4733,"i":39,"name":"Vogtsbach Forest","tags":[],"note":"A forest sacred to local Shwazen Spirits."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":955,"y":570.3,"cell":4966,"i":40,"name":"Ungenkirch Forest","tags":[],"note":"A forest sacred to local Shwazen Spirits."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":531.58,"y":400.37,"cell":3390,"i":41,"name":"Slutslase Forest","tags":[],"note":"A forest sacred to local Slovan Beliefs."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":632.27,"y":432.85,"cell":3698,"i":42,"name":"Denia Forest","tags":[],"note":"A forest sacred to local Elladan Spirits."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":568.77,"y":247.95,"cell":1800,"i":43,"name":"Segnone Forest","tags":[],"note":"A forest sacred to local Tallian Pantheon."},{"icon":"glyph-1f332","type":"sacred-pineries","px":13,"x":1492.56,"y":262.73,"cell":1993,"i":44,"name":"Nesvik Pinery","tags":[],"note":"A pinery sacred to local Norse Spirits."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1699.58,"y":484.64,"cell":4330,"i":45,"name":"Gilah Jaguars","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1495.85,"y":545.23,"cell":4893,"i":46,"name":"Bongen Rooks","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1682.59,"y":509.83,"cell":4566,"i":47,"name":"Walfach Jackals","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":141.72,"y":550.93,"cell":4812,"i":48,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":739.62,"y":805.02,"cell":6840,"i":49,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1356,"y":306.7,"cell":2264,"i":50,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":351.34,"y":525.48,"cell":4603,"i":51,"name":"Aslayazbey Pillar","tags":[],"note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc21\udc0a𐠳𐠢\udc35\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠲\udc11\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠅\udc02\udc05\udc14\ud802𐠭\ud802  \ud802𐠠\udc35\udc2e\udc27𐠓\udc1f  \ud802\ud802𐠋𐠋\ud802𐠗𐠤𐠠\udc19𐠍\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠥\udc25𐠂\udc0d\udc34\udc2d\ud802\ud802𐠔\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":262.29,"y":517.49,"cell":4596,"i":52,"name":"Sazbay Sculpture","tags":[],"note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc31𐠙\udc35 𐠜𐠐\udc35\udc27𐠙\udc1b\udc37\ud802𐠘\ud802𐠜𐠍\ud802𐠌\udc10\udc37\udc26\udc24𐠁𐠧\udc37\udc08\udc1f 𐠩\udc31𐠅𐠛\ud802𐠲\udc1b𐠚\udc2e𐠚\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠖\ud802 \udc2d\udc2b\ud802\ud802𐠜\udc27\udc1f\ud802𐠭𐠞\udc29\udc18𐠔\udc25𐠊𐠌\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠫\ud802𐠪\udc3c</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":479.45,"y":88.86,"cell":366,"i":53,"name":"Sani Effigy","tags":[],"note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠬\udc37\udc02\udc12\udc0a\ud802𐠳𐠳\ud802𐠐\udc34\ud802𐠱 𐠊𐠜\udc0e\ud802\ud802𐠮\udc1c\udc0d\ud802 \udc1f\udc24\ud802𐠦 𐠨\ud802𐠑𐠿\udc05𐠝\udc0a\ud802 \udc16\udc0f\udc31\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠸\ud802𐠟\udc08\udc04𐠩\udc12\udc34\udc28\udc31\ud802𐠷𐠵\udc2f\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1625.53,"y":639.41,"cell":5792,"i":54,"name":"Schlisach Pillar","tags":[],"note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༩༲༃༆༼༓༅༘༿༯༃༑༫༡༿༨༴༜༯༃༩༩༴༇༊༸༿༅༒༆༌༐༲༺༫༵༧༪༻༘༙༊༮༗༾༯༨༐༘༆༨༺༆༧༅༘༅༡༲༠༮༵༬༤༰༠༨༗༱༂༫༲༗༡༧༓༈༚༸ༀ༈༊་༛༬༖༷༿༇༣</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":907.6,"y":140.6,"cell":716,"i":55,"name":"Ruined Mausoleum","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":196.64,"y":506.08,"cell":4476,"i":56,"name":"Ruined Castle","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":359.53,"y":173.41,"cell":1023,"i":57,"name":"Ruined Fortification","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1421.2,"y":433.3,"cell":3748,"i":58,"name":"Ruined Fortification","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4da","type":"libraries","x":620.59,"y":323.26,"cell":2501,"i":59,"name":"Supimontata Library","tags":[],"note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":213.8,"y":191.79,"cell":1130,"i":60,"name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":1728.38,"y":249.31,"cell":1881,"i":61,"name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":824.26,"y":379.25,"cell":3142,"i":62,"name":"Travelling Magical Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this magical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f93a","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":598.61,"y":96.44,"cell":468,"i":63,"name":"Demir Contest","tags":[],"note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a contest of speed in Demir, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3a0","type":"fairs","x":1763.57,"y":259.96,"cell":2013,"i":64,"name":"Yizrelgal Fair","tags":[],"note":"A fair is being held in Yizrelgal, offering local coal alongside foreign goods and services."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6c3","type":"customs-houses","x":1138.21,"y":514.99,"cell":4517,"i":65,"name":"Bonwegen Customs House","tags":[],"note":"A customs house of Eschbronia on the road from Ricken. Carts queue at its barrier while the wardens weigh their loads and collect the tariffs."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6c3","type":"customs-houses","x":1065.5,"y":636.3,"cell":5609,"i":66,"name":"Bobelberge Customs House","tags":[],"note":"A customs house of Eschbronia on the road from Steimonsia. Carts queue at its barrier while the wardens weigh their loads and collect the tariffs."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6f6","type":"canoes","x":1461.25,"y":143.38,"cell":863,"i":67,"name":"Minor Jetty","tags":[],"note":"A small location along the Dachsberg River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"icon":"glyph-1f417","type":"migration","x":1541.75,"y":277.29,"cell":2132,"i":68,"name":"Wolves migration","tags":[],"note":"A huge group of wolves are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":320.92,"y":371.01,"cell":3098,"i":69,"name":"Tayliyol Ravine","tags":[],"note":"The Tayliyol Ravine. Locals claim that it is totally empty."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1450.4,"y":356.69,"cell":3044,"i":70,"name":"Thetford Crypt","tags":[],"note":"A towering necropolis adorned with macabre sculptures and guarded by formidable undead sentinels. Its ancient halls house the remains of fallen heroes, entombed alongside their cherished relics."},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":192.55,"y":497.2,"cell":4363,"i":71,"name":"Random encounter","tags":[],"note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4363\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-o